.PP
.nf
Convert an absolute path to a directory name for use in a cache\&.

The algorithm used is:

#\&. On Windows, any ``':'`` in the drive is replaced with ``'---'``\&.
#\&. Any occurrence of ``os\&.sep`` is replaced with ``'--'``\&.
#\&. ``'\&.cache'`` is appended\&.

.fi
